# --- packaging weight -------------------------------------------------------
# The two guitar soundfonts are ~162 MB together and were the entire reason the
# VSIX weighed 137 MB. Only the 1.3 MB general-purpose bank ships; point
# `alphatab.soundFonts` at local .sf2 files to use anything else.
webview/sound/**
!webview/sound/sonivox.sf2

# Legacy Bravura formats no webview engine can reach (Electron is Chromium):
# .eot is IE-only and .svg fonts were removed from Blink in 2015. 2.2 MB saved.
webview/font/Bravura.eot
webview/font/Bravura.svg

# Demo GIFs are hotlinked from the README, not read from the package.
figure/**

package-lock.json
CLAUDE.md
